126
00:11:35,680 --> 00:11:37,270
It matches with your

127
00:11:37,880 --> 00:11:39,150
Life and Death Domain.

128
00:11:42,360 --> 00:11:43,150
That's why...

129
00:11:43,960 --> 00:11:45,030
That's why...

130
00:11:46,000 --> 00:11:47,550
Use killing intent to take lives

131
00:11:49,080 --> 00:11:51,160
